      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TORPEY HAYZE (5) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (19.64) at this track in a Grade 6. Has first look at box 5 this time. Expected to feature in the finish again. PANNONIA (3) was never in contention last time after drifting back at this track, but prior to that won by a neck at this track (16.83) beating Slide City in a Maiden on July 27. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Expected to give a good account. CUSTARD (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 3.5 lengths from the winner (17.16). Has ability and is one of the better chances. HAYMET HARRY (8) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
